<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Hla Chhuanvâwr</book>
  <para style="h">Hla Chhuanvâwr</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hla Chhuanvâwr</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hla Chhuanvâwr</para>
  <para style="mt">Hla Chhuanvâwr</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona hla chhuanvâwr
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Min fâwp vawng vawng mai teh, Uain hnehin a thlum i hmangaihna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tui veng veng mang e i rimte chu, I sakhming mawi chuan rimtui lêng vêl a iang e. Chuvâng alâwm nulate chuan an nêp zawh loh che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Min zai ta che, i tlân dûn ang, Ka lal ni la, i pindanah min hruai ang che, Hlimin nui hiau ila Hmangaihna uain i tlân dûn ang, Hmangaih âwm rêng i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem nulate u, Ka hâng na a, ngaihno ka bei a nia, Kedar puan in angin hâng mah ila, Solomona puanzâr mawi ang ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka han deuh avângin mi iai suh u, Ni sa ka tuar vâng mai a ni. Ka nuṭate an thinur a, Grep huan min vêntîr a, Ka intuaihnûm hman lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Min hrilh teh, aw duh tak, Khaw nge i berâmte i tlattîra, Chhûnah khaw nge i chawlhtîr ṭhin? Nangmah zawngin berâmpu dang zîngah Ka vâk ruai dâwn em ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmeichhia azawnga mawi ber, I hriat loh chuan ran rual sûlhnu chhui la, Berâmpute bûk bulah chuan I kêltête tlattîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka teh ber che, aw ka duh tak, Farawa tawlailîr hnûk sakawrla nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I bianga bahsam uai chu a mawi mang e, I ṭhi awrhte nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tangkaraw phûm rangkachak khim tûr Kan siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka lal chu laikhumah a zâl, Ka nard rim chuan in chhûng a khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mura rimtui fûn ang maiin Ka duh tak chu ka ṭânglaiah a bei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu hena pâr bâwr ang, Engedi huana pâr vul chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, duh tak, I va han mawi tak êm! I mit meng lah ṭhuva ang lo ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh, duh tak, i va mawi êm! En ka nuam ngei a che. Kan zâlna chhâwl a hring nghial e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan in chung chu sidar, A thuahtu pawh fâr thing.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei zawng Saron phaia tûktinpâr leh Ruama lilipâr ang chauh hi ka ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lanu rual zîngah, ka duh tak chu Hlîng zînga lilipâr ang hi asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu vâl rual zîngah, Ngaw kâr apple kûng ang hi a ni. A hlima ṭhut nuam ka ti, A rahte pawh a thlum bîk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uain huanah min hruai lût a, Hmangaihnain min zial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grep chhang min barh a, A zûna uai, apple theiin min tiharh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kut vei lam ka lukham a, A ding lamin min pawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem nulate u, Ram zukchal leh ram zukpui chhâlin Ka ngên tlat a che u, Duh tâwk a ngah hma chu kan induh lai min tho suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu! Ka duh taka aw chu, Saw, a lo kal e. Tlângah a lo tlân a, Mualah a lo zuang ṭum e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu khâm saza ang. Sakhituai ang mai hi. Bang phênah sâwn a ding ta e, Tukverhah min rawn thlîr a, Bang âwng kârah min rawn bih e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh tak chuan mi han bia a: Duh tak tho la, lo kal teh khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlasik a tâwp ta a, Ruahtui a hul tawh e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Phûlah pâr tin a vul ṭan a, A her chhuak e, sîrva hrâm hun, Mîmsîrikût a hrâm tâk chu Kan lo ramah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theipui hel pawh a hmin dâwn ta, Grep pâr rim pawh a nam rem rem, Ti rawh, duh tak, tho teh, bawihte, I kal teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I iang kher mai lungpui kâra ṭhuva biru, Khâmrâng kâra chêng chu; I sakhmêl mawi rawn inlan teh, Hriat ka nuam e, i ânka nêm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sihal notê rual saw man rawh u, Sâwng tê tê sâwn kan grep pâr lai An tiṭil zo dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu ka ta a ni, Lilipâr zînga berâm tlattîrtu saw
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zîng thlifîm a tleh a, Tlai khua a vâr hma hian, Rimtui tlânga saza tla leh sathâr angin, Duh tak, lo haw zên zên ta che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Laikhum zâlin zan tin ka dâwn ṭhîn a, Ka dap vêl a, ka duh tak chu A awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Ka tho vang a, kan vâng khawpui fangin, Ka duh tak chu, thlêr tin, Daikâwm hrûtin ka zawng dâwn e.’ Ka zawng ruai a, ka tawng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawpui vêngtu kal vêlte chuan min hmu, Ka duh tak chu an tawng emaw ka han zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni ka pelh hnu lawkah chuan Ka duh tak chu ka hmu a, Ka vuan tlat a, Ka nu pindan, min hrinnaah Ka hruai luh hma loh chu Ka thlah phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem nulate u, Khâm saza leh ram zukchal chhâlin Ka ngên tlat a che u, Duh tâwk a ngah hma chu, Kan induh lai min tho suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu a ni nge meikhu ding ang, thlalêra lo kal saw? Dâwra an zawrh mura rim leh beraw rimtui a nam veng veng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal Solomona, bâwmin an rawn zâwn a, Pheisen vâl rual kawp sawmthumin an vêng, Israel zînga chhuanvâwrte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngûnhnâm vai thiam hlîr an ni a, Râlhrât tak vek an ni. An khandaihte an pai ṭheuh va, Zâna rawn beitu an ûm lêt nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng thinga siam zâwnbâwm chhûngah Solomona a ṭhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A zâwnfung tangkarua, A khuhna rangkachak zai tah khâwm, A ṭhutna, puan senduka tuam, Jerusalem nuten uluk taka an siam A chhûng chei nân an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion nulate u, lo chhuak ula, Solomona hi lo hmuak rawh u. A nupui neih ni, a hlimna ni-ah hian, Lukhum cheimawi a nu’n a khumtîr hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, duh tak, i mawi mang e, Ngai teh, i nalh ngei mai. I inkhuhna phêna i mit meng chuan a iang e ṭhuva, A iang rêng e i bahsam chuan Gilead tlânga lêngkêl tlân thla seng seng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I hâte chu a vâr siau va, Berâm hmul meh hlim bual fai angin, A kawpkim fer mai a, Bal rêng a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zozâm iangin i heh a sen ser a, I hmuiphun chu a mawi ngei mai. I hmai khuhna phênah i biang a tai têk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I nghâwngin a iang e Davida râlthuam in sâng, Râlhrât phaw sâng tam tak an bânna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I ṭângnêmin a iang e saza phîr Lili zînga tla dûnte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zîng thlifîm a tleh a, tlaikhua a vâr hma hian Mura tlângah ka kal teh ang, Beraw hmunpuiah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Duh tak, i hmêl a va mawi êm! Iaiawm lai rêng a awm lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng ata, ti rawh, lungdi, Lebanon tlâng ata i chhuk dûn ang. Amana tlângchhîp ata chu lo chhuk la, Sakeibaknei leh keite chênna Senir leh Hermon tlâng ata i chhuk dûn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawihte, kei ka lungdi, Min zial â zo dâwn alâwm, Vawi khat mitsîr ka buai phah e, I ṭhi mal awrh vei nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawihte, i hmangaihna a duhawm kher mang e, Kei ka lungdi, uain hnehin ka thlang i hmangaihna, Rim azawngah i rim a tui ber a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw ka lungdi, i hmui khawipui zuin a far, I ânka khawizu leh hnutetui ang, I silhfên pawh Lebanon rim a nam rem rem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka lungdi, ka bawihtei chu, Huan humhalh tlat ang hi a ni, Huan hung, tu ma khawih loh tui hna tamna ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tah chuan theibuhfai a tlim hmur a, A rah tiar tuar bawk ṭhîn. Hena leh Nard a tam êm êm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nard leh safron te, ṭhal thing leh thakthîng te, Beraw leh Mura, Aloe te chînna rimtui tinrêng awmna hmun chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tah chuan tui a tam a, A luang dur dur, Lebanon tlânga hnâr nei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmâr thli, lo thawk teh, Chhim thli, lo tleh ta che, Ka huan hi han chhêm la, A rim chhêm darh vêl teh, Ka duh tak chu a huanah hian lo kal sela, A thei duh ber han ei rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thai bawihte, Ka huanah chuan ka lo kal a, Mura leh rimtui ka lâwr khâwm a, A thlâr chawpin khawizu ka ei ta a, Uain chu hnutetui nên ka in ta e. Lenrualte u, ei ula, in rawh u, Hmangaihna in ruih hnêp hma chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka zâl na a, ka chhîng lêm lo, Chu! Ka duh tak chuan kawng a rawn kik. Duh tak, kawng min hawn rawh, Aw ka lungdi, ka ṭhûvate, ka enchim loh, Daiin ka lu a far huh a, Zân chhûmin min tihnawm zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka inphelh vek tawh a, Ka inbel ṭha leh dâwn em ni? Ka ke ka sil tawh a, Ka tibawlhhlawh leh dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka duh tak chuan kawngkhâr âwngah a rawn zen a, A hnai êm a, ka zauthau zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kawng hawng tûrin ka han tho va, Ka kut Mura tuiah ka chiah a, Ka zungṭangah a far. A kalhna chu ka han hawng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka han hawn chuan ka duh tak chu A aw hriat ka chak nên, a kal bo hman ta si. Ka zawng chiam a, ka tawng si lo, Ka au ruai a, min chhâng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui vênga kal vêlte nên kan intawng a, Min vaw nek a, min hliam ta a, Vêngtute chuan ka inkhuhna min hlîmsak bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem nulate u, ka ngên tlat a che u, Ka duh tak chu in hmuh hlauh chuan, A zûn ngaia ka uai thu hi, Han hrilh ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeichhia azawnga mawi ber, I duh tak chu eng nge a duhawm bîk, Mi dang aia a ṭhat bîkna, Chuti êma min ngen tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu a ṭha sensiar a, Sâng sâwm zîngah a ṭha chungnung e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sakhmêlin rangka dârtui a iang a, A lu a kir chiat a. A bahsam dum ziar e lianâk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A chhîngmit chuan a iang ṭhûva, luite kama fu, Hnutetuia bual hlim chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A biang chu hlo rimtui hmun, rimtui nam reng a ni, A hmuite chu lilipâr vul, mura rim kai ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A bân chu rangkachak mûm lungmantam phûmna ang hi a ni, A sakruang chu saingho Safir lung bel ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A châwn chu alabasta lung vâr, Rangkachaka inhûng ang hi a ni. A sakhmêlin Lebanon tlâng Sidar hmunpui a iang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kam a thlum ngei mai, A pumin a duhawm, Aw Jerusalem nulate u, Chutiang chu a ni, ka duh tak chu, Chutiang chu a ni, ka hmangaih chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw nang, hmeichhe zînga mawi ber, Khaw nge i duh tak chu a kal, Khawi lam ber nge i duh tak chuan a pan kan han zawnpui ang che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu a chhuk, huanah, Rimtui huan zâwlah chuan. Berâm a tlattîr a, Lilipârte a lâwr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka duh tak chu ka ta a ni, Kei pawh a ta ka ni, Lili zînga berâm tlattîrtu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I mawi mang e, duh tak. Tirza khawpui iangin i duhawm e, Jerusalem iangin, Ka teh ber che pheisen dâr fêng puanzâr khai nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hnutiang min chhawn mai teh, Min bual â zo dâwn e, A iang ngei e i bahsam chuan Gilead tlânga lêngkêl tlân thla seng seng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I hâte chu berâmla rual bual fai hlim ang a ni, A kawpkim fer mai a, Bal rêng a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I hmai khuhna phênah I biangte chu a tai têk si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalnu sawmruk leh hmei sawmriat, Nula chhiar sên lohte awm mah sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ṭhûvatê, ka enchim loh chauh hi a ni ka duh, A nu fa neih chhun, a duat bîk chu. Nulaten an hmuhin nihlawh an ti a, Lalnute leh hmeite pawhin an fak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu a ni nge zîng êng anga lo chhuak pheu hi, Chhawrthlapui leh tûrni êng a iang e, Pheisen dâr fêng puanzâr keng nên ka teh ber che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawkherh hmunah ka zu chhuk a, Lui kama thil chawrno ka en dâwn e, Grepte a kuhmûm tawh emaw, theibuhfai a pâr emaw Ka zu en dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kiangah chuan sâng sâwm zînga lalber Ka ni emaw ka inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lâm teh, lâm teh, Sulam nula, I lâm kan thlîr dâwn a che. Engtizia nge thlîrtu zînga Sulam nula ka lâm min en duh le?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pheikhawk buna i pên a va mawi êm! Aw nang, milian fanu, I malte chuan a iang e lungmantam chei, Mi themthiam nawh mâm chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I lai pawh hian uain tlinna no mawi a iang ngei e, I laibu lah buh chhûn vûm Lilipâra hual chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I ṭângnêm chuan saza phîr, Tla dûn rial rial a iang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I nghâwngin a iang e saingho in sâng, I mit mengin Hesbon dîl, Bath-rabbim kulh kawngkhâr kianga awm chu. I hnârin a iang e, Lebanon in sâng, Damaska khaw vênna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I lu chhîpin a iang e, Karmel tlângchhîp, I bahsam uai a dum ziar a, A kir chuan lal hi a zial tlat e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I va mawi êm! I duhawm ngei mai e! Ka duh tak, lung tiawi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I tlâwntlai ṭha, tûm thing angin, I ṭângnêm chuan a rah bâwr a iang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûm thingah chuan han lâwn ila, A rahte chu ka lo teh ang; I ṭângnêm chu grep bâwr ang hi a ni, I thaw chuan apple rim a nam hiam e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I kam chhuak chu uain thlum ber, Lem a nuamin a tui ngei mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh taka ta chu ka ni, Min ngai ve êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ti rawh, duh tak, phûlah lêng dûn ila, Khuaahte sâwn i riak dûn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Grep huanah va zîng lên ila, A chawr emaw, a pâr emaw i en dûn ang. Theibuhfai pawh a pâr emaw i en dûn ang. Tah chuan ka hmangaihna ka hlân ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâwlaidi rim a nam rem rem, Thei tui tak, lawh hlim leh a hmin dûp te, Kan kawngka bulah kan dah e. Duh tak, a hmin ṭha ṭha i tân ka khêk a nia.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka nu hnute hne ve, ka nuṭa chu ni la, Tuala kan intawh khân ka fâwp chawt ngei ang che, Tu man min dem lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kai ang che a, ka nu pindan rilah, Kan hruai ang che. Tah chuan hmangaih min zirtîr ang. Uain rimtui ka hlân ang che a, Theibuhfai sâwr ka intîr bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A bân vei lam chu ka lukham a, A ding lam chuan min pawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem nulate u, ka ngên tlat a che u, Duh tâwk a ngah hma chu Kan induh lai min tho suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A duh tak nên innghêng riala, Thlalêr ata lo chho saw tu nge ni? Apple buk hnuaiah ka kai harh che, Tah chuan a ni i nu’n a vei che a, A hrin tâk che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lunglai rilah min vuan tlat la, Keimah lo chu lêng dang chhai suh, Hmangaihna hi thihna angin a chak a, Thîkthu pawh hi Seol angin chin lêm a nei lo ve, Mei alh hluah hluah ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuia leih mih rual a ni lo, Lui lian pawhin a chîm hlum zo hek lo, Hmangaihna hi miin a sum neih zawng zawngin Lei tum sela, a tân a zahthlâk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Farnu te tak tê kan nei a, A hnute pawh sawi tham a la ni lo, Kan farnu tân eng nge kan tihsak ang, Inlêng a neih hunah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kulh bang ni se, Tangkaraw bang pâwng kan siamsak ang, Kawngkhâr ni se, Sidar phêkin kan tuam thuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kulh bang ka ni alâwm, Ka hnute pawh kulh bang pâwng ang a ni, Min han enin a lung ka tiawi tâwk na e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomonan Baal-hamon hmunah Grep huan a nei. Thlawhhlawhtute a neihtîr a, Tangka sâng ṭheuh lei man an pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomonan tangka sâng chu lo têl mai se, Thlawhhlawhtuten tangka zahnih pawh chu lo chang ang hmiang, Kei pawh grep huan ka nei ve bawk alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Duh tak, huana awm, i aw ka lo ngaithla ang e, Ṭhiante pawhin hriat an châk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rimtui tlânga saza leh zuktuai an tla angin Duh tak, lo zuang ṭum rawh.
  </para>
</usx>
